---
---

<section class="hero-banner">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="hero-chip">鑑定品・レトロカード入荷</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title display">その一枚を、<span class="accent">NEO</span>で掘り出す。</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">PSA鑑定品から旧裏面レトロカードまで。店頭・宅配どちらの買取にも対応しています。</p>
    <a class="hero-btn display" href="/zaiko/">在庫をチェックする</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <div class="card-fan">
      <div class="foil-card card-a"><div class="foil-card-inner"></div></div>
      <div class="foil-card card-c"><div class="foil-card-inner"></div></div>
      <div class="foil-card card-b"><div class="foil-card-inner"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="dots" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="active"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-banner {
    position: relative; margin-top: 18px; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--zone-dark-bg); min-height: 340px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; align-items: center;
    padding: 40px; gap: 24px; color: var(--zone-dark-text);
  }
  .hero-banner::before, .hero-banner::after { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: 0; }
  .hero-banner::before {
    width: 60%; height: 220%; background: var(--zone-dark-panel); opacity: 0.9;
    top: -60%; left: -18%; transform: rotate(18deg);
  }
  .hero-banner::after {
    width: 34%; height: 220%; background: #46454c; opacity: 0.8;
    top: -60%; left: 10%; transform: rotate(18deg);
  }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-chip { display: inline-block; background: #fff; color: #101010; font-weight: 900; font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 3px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h1.hero-title { font-size: clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 46px); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 14px; text-wrap: balance; }
  h1.hero-title .accent {
    background: var(--zone-dark-text); color: var(--zone-dark-bg);
    padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 15px; color: var(--zone-dark-text-soft); max-width: 42ch; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .hero-btn {
    display: inline-block; background: var(--zone-dark-text); color: var(--zone-dark-bg);
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 14px; border: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 26px;
    cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hero-visual { position: relative; z-index: 1; height: 100%; min-height: 220px; }
  .card-fan { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .foil-card {
    position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 44%; aspect-ratio: 5/7;
    border-radius: 7% / 5%; background: var(--zone-dark-text);
    border: 2px solid var(--zone-dark-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -16px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .foil-card-inner {
    position: absolute; inset: 6%; border-radius: 5% / 4%; background: var(--zone-dark-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card-a { transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-15deg) translateX(-34%); z-index: 1; opacity: 0.9; }
  .card-b { transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-1deg) translateY(-6%); z-index: 2; }
  .card-c { transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(13deg) translateX(34%); z-index: 1; opacity: 0.9; }

  .dots { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 14px; }
  .dots span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line); display: inline-block; }
  .dots span.active { background: var(--ink); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-banner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 28px; }
    .hero-visual { min-height: 180px; }
  }
</style>
